# Compiler emit is ignored only where the file is emit BY DEFINITION. The broad
# `**/src/**/*.js` / `**/src/**/*.d.ts` globs are forbidden: `.gitignore` cannot
# express "ignore this only when a same-stem .ts sibling exists", so they also hide
# authored declarations. The sibling rule is enforced against tracked files by
# `sdkwork-specs/tools/check-repository-baseline-content.mjs` instead.

# Local backup copy of a previously generated SDK tree (superseded by the
# tracked `server-openapi` directory); never commit.
**/server-openapi-old/

# Scratch probe scripts and one-off fixup helpers (never commit).
/scripts/tmp-*

